COL-1007 = '''
At the base field, the normalized integral comparison of COL-1008 sends the literal
rational graph to its unit. The original coefficient cone has positive
integral insertion, and degree-two integral weight-one cohomology vanishes.
Its exact sequence therefore reduces the finite computation to that same
unit group modulo actual powers. Retain the graph and norm formulas when
passing to the quotient, including at level zero and in positive characteristic.
'''
